# Proposed stable deployment; template only, not evidence of a running public service.
# Authentication remains on Vxture. The product domain is independently configured.
COSPACE_OIDC_ISSUER=https://accounts.vxture.com
COSPACE_OIDC_BACKCHANNEL=https://accounts.vxture.com
COSPACE_OIDC_CLIENT_ID=cospace
COSPACE_ORIGIN=https://cospace.ruyin.work
COSPACE_WEBSITE_BASE_URL=https://vxture.com
COSPACE_OIDC_LOOPBACK_HTTP=0
# Required: platform-issued COSPACE_OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET, outside this repository.
# Required: stable Fernet COSPACE_SESSION_KEY, outside this repository.
# Required: COSPACE_PLATFORM_API_URL, trusted internal platform-api origin (no path).
# Tailnet HTTP is allowed only with COSPACE_PLATFORM_TAILNET_HTTP=1 and a 100.64.0.0/10 address.
# Required: COSPACE_PLATFORM_WEBHOOK_SECRET, registered per-product signing key, at least 32 characters.
# Optional: COSPACE_PLATFORM_WEBHOOK_PREVIOUS_SECRET during a controlled signing-key rotation.
# The business service refuses startup without subscription configuration.
# Lifecycle: launch readiness, publish approved plans, real subscribed use, then stable acceptance.
